(1147,'frFR','Ha! That ichor you\'re covered in actually makes you prettier, $Gname&gt;! It certainly does make you reek at the same time though. Don\'t stand too close to the kodo; you\'ll either start a stampede or cause them to go into heat.$B<br :>I think my companions would agree that your smell alone is proof you\'ve done your part to help us against those insect creatures. Thank you, &lt;name.',18019),
