(1267,'frFR','Let me be first to thank you for all you\'ve done, $N. You have been an incredible blessing to my people and the people of Stormwind. I am sorry I couldn\'t make your acquaintance under better circumstances.$B$BUnderstand also that I cannot overtly thank you for your efforts, but I assure you again, it is appreciated.$B$BWhen you visit Theramore in the future, seek me out and I shall try to keep you appraised of the situation.$B$BThank you again, $N.',18019),
