(25949,'frFR','Le Cercle terrestre a re+ºu mon message de d+®tresse et nous a envoy+® de lÔÇÖaide. +ça tombe +á pic, on dirait.$B$BEsp+®rons que lÔÇÖaide continue +á arriver. Nous ne sommes quÔÇÖune poign+®e face +á des l+®gions.',18019),
(25950,'frFR','Chicken and rice, &lt;name&gt;! That will show those sorry and sad snakes who\'s the ol\' pitch and toss!$B$BNow it\'s bird lime for that tiddlywink. Finger and thumb or plink plonk?',18019),
